  {
   "id": "hook",
   "text": "Your CI ran terraform apply on a plan nobody reviewed."
  },
  {
   "id": "bug",
   "text": "Apply without a plan file makes a brand new plan at apply time."
  },
  {
   "id": "why",
   "text": "Someone merged, or the cloud drifted, and what runs is not what you approved."
  },
  {
   "id": "fix",
   "text": "Save the plan with dash out. Then apply that exact file. If the state changed since, Terraform rejects it as stale. Review in CI, then apply the saved plan."
  },
  {
   "id": "bait",
   "text": "Saved plan, or fresh apply? Comment which one your team uses."
  },
  {
   "id": "follow",
   "text": "Follow me for one DevOps fix every day."
  }
